  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "カスタマイズで量産機の枠を超えろ！",
      "en": "Go beyond the limits of mass-produced machines with customization!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "シンプルな構造で組み立てが簡単なBANDAI SPIRITSオリジナルロボットプラモデルシリーズ、「30 MINUTES MISSIONS」から、「eEXM-17 アルト[グリーン]」が1/144スケールで登場。",
      "en": "\"eEXM-17 Alto [Green]\" is now available in 1/144 Scale from the \" 30 MINUTES MISSIONS\" BANDAI SPIRITS original robot plastic model series with a simple structure and easy assembly."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 組み立てが簡単だから、たくさんつくれる！たくさん集めたくなる！",
      "en": "• Assembly is easy, so you can make a lot! Makes you want to collect a lot!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 同じ機体で複数のカラーバリエーションを展開。塗装なしでも好みのカラーリングを楽しめる。",
      "en": "• Multiple color variations available with the same aircraft. You can enjoy your favorite coloring without painting."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• シリーズ共通の関節構造を採用。異なる機体同士でもユニットの組み換えやパーツ換装が可能。",
      "en": "• Adopts joint structure common to the series. It is possible to recombine units and replace parts even between different aircraft."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 各所に設けられた３mm穴のハードポイントで様々なカスタマイズが可能。",
      "en": "• Various customization is possible with the 3mm hole hard points provided in various locations."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• サブマシンガンなど各種武装が付属。",
      "en": "• Various weapons such as submachine guns are included."
    }
  ],
